{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Meatsaw adds its flat damage after the weapon percent (#12867)",
  "contract": [
    "#12867: Meatsaw seemed to deal only part of its tooltip. Rank 5 578119 reads 'dealing $s2% Weapon Damage plus",
    "$s1': 56% weapon damage plus 143-178. Its DBC lists the flat effect (121) before the percent effect (31), so the",
    "engine multiplied the flat value by 56% too. The maintainer ruled that Meatsaw follows its tooltip, so the chain",
    "uses AscensionFlatAfterWeaponPercent (ADR 0010). An unarmed level 60 Knight of Xoroth with 200-400 attack power",
    "has 35-71 normalized weapon damage, so a hit is 162-218 with the flat value added in full and at most 139 when",
    "it is multiplied. The level 1 target barely mitigates it (asserted at 990 per 1000 or more) and damage-done and",
    "damage-taken modifiers stay within 2% (asserted), so non-critical hits must average 150-235."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 120000,
  "players": [
    {
      "id": "k",
      "race": 1,
      "class": 17,
      "level": 60,
      "melee_hit_rating": 10000,
      "expertise_rating": 10000,
      "allow_regeneration": false
    }
  ],
  "creatures": [
    {
      "id": "dummy",
      "owner": "k",
      "entry": 36,
      "level": 1,
      "min_level_armor": true,
      "health": 50000000,
      "distance": 3
    }
